WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.080
Live from Jack Kent Coke Stadium stadium

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.340
it's the Battle of the Bin number one!

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:14.360
The undefeated Four Loko are looking to bring
their champagne tonight

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:16.640
but before they can get their tabs on the
Pimm's Cup,

00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:20.420
they'll have to go through Joose, the new
QB from Mezcal Tech.

00:00:20.430 --> 00:00:22.750
You know he's going to get blitzed tonight,

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.160
the rookie gets his shot to prove himself,

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:30.220
after their top shelf QB was suspended for
texting photos of his cocktail.

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:34.560
The skies are ever clear, the club seats are
filled and the cans are going wild.

00:00:34.560 --> 00:00:37.460
Here's the kick off and it's a high ball.

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:44.320
We must protect children from the severe and
deadly consequences

00:00:44.320 --> 00:00:50.740
of drinks like Four Loko and Joose and some
of the other ones.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.260
And ever since this caffeine based, liquor
laced combo

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:10.800
has traveled the world from California's trendiest
bars to the Australian outback

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:16.130
simply because it offers a two in one combination
of things that late night revelers love:

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:18.600
caffeine and alcohol.

